## What it is

A content-managed portfolio built on Next.js and Keystatic, deployed on Vercel. This page is generated from that system.

## Design system

- Zero border-radius and black panelling
- Orange / cyan accent toggle (palettes: Asimov, Vulcan, Manticore, Donatello)
- The **БОГMODE** Cyrillic wordmark
- One method across everything: **Observe → Map → Build → Measure → Learn**
